      "q": "How much does Booz Allen Hamilton make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Booz Allen Hamilton obligated $4.9B in FY2026 to date. Booz Allen Hamilton's FY2026 to date obligations came via 909 awards with an average award size of $5.4M. These figures are fiscal year to date obligations and do not represent full fiscal year totals."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Booz Allen Hamilton?",
      "a": "The General Services Administration is the largest buyer of Booz Allen Hamilton in FY2026 to date at $2B, followed by the Department of Defense at $1.7B. Other buying agencies in FY2026 to date include the Department of Health and Human Services at $296M, the Department of Veterans Affairs at $278M, and the Department of Homeland Security at $114M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Booz Allen Hamilton sell to the government?",
